    {
      "@id": "_:b264",
      "@type": "aas:LangStringNameType",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Granularity"
    },
    {
      "@id": "_:b266",
      "@type": "aas:LangStringTextType",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The granularity of the Product. There are three values: ‘Model‘, ‘Item‘ and ‘Batch‘."
    },
    {
      "@id": "_:b268",
      "@type": "aas:AdministrativeInformation",
      "revision": "0",
      "version": "1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "_:b269",
      "@type": "aas:EmbeddedDataSpecification",
      "dataSpecification": "_:b270",
      "dataSpecificationContent": "_:b273"
    },
    {
      "@id": "_:b270",
      "@type": "aas:Reference",
      "aas:Reference/type": {
        "@id": "aas:ReferenceTypes/ExternalReference"
      },
      "keys": "_:b271"
    },
    {
      "@id": "_:b271",
      "@type": "aas:Key",
      "aas:Key/type": {
        "@id": "aas:KeyTypes/GlobalReference"
      },
      "aas:Key/value": "https://admin-shell.io/DataSpecificationTemplates/DataSpecificationIec61360/3"
    },
    {
      "@id": "_:b273",
      "@type": "aas:DataSpecificationIec61360",
      "dataType": "aas:DataTypeIec61360/String",
      "definition": "_:b278",
      "preferredName": "_:b274",
      "shortName": "_:b276",
      "valueList": "_:b280"
    },
    {
      "@id": "_:b274",
      "@type": "aas:LangStringPreferredNameTypeIec61360",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "granularity"
    },
    {
      "@id": "_:b276",
      "@type": "aas:LangStringShortNameTypeIec61360",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "granularity"
    },
    {
      "@id": "_:b278",
      "@type": "aas:LangStringDefinitionTypeIec61360",
      "language": "en",
      "text": " \nThe granularity of the Product. \n\nThere are three values: ‘Model‘, ‘Item‘ and ‘Batch‘.\n\nThe term ‘model‘ usually refers to a version of a product of which all units share the same technical characteristics relevant for the ecodesign requirements \nand the same model identifier, the term ‘batch‘ usually refers to a subset \nof a specific model composed of all products produced in a specific manufacturing plant at a specific moment \nin time and the term ‘item’ usually refers to a single unit of a model. \n\nSOURCE: ESPR p2024/1781, REGULATION (EU) 2024/1781 OF THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT AND OF THE COUNCIL of 13 June 2024 \nestablishing a framework for the setting of ecodesign requirements for sustainable products, \namending Directive (EU) 2020/1828 and Regulation (EU) 2023/1542 and repealing Directive 2009/125/EC. URI: OJ:L_202401781\n"
    },
    {
